# Exclude markdown documentation but allow blog content (AEO articles).
# Without the negation rules below, `content/blog/*.md` was being filtered
# out of the Railway build context (snapshot dropped from ~3MB to 2.1MB),
# which made `generateStaticParams()` return empty and the [slug] route
# fall through to notFound() at request time. See BUY-45847 / BUY-46949.
*.md
!content/
!content/blog/
!content/blog/*.md
# Same fix for the published docs: the *.md filter above also dropped
# docs/**/*.md from the Railway build context, so getAllDocs() and
# generateStaticParams() returned empty and /docs/[...slug] 404'd at
# request time (GSC 'Page with redirect' / noindex). Re-include them.
!docs/
!docs/**/*.md
!docs/*.md
*.sh
data/
output/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
